# Odoo Connector module - English

ModuleOdooConnectorName=Odoo Connector
OdooConnectorSetup=Odoo Connector Setup
OdooConnectorConnection=Connection to Odoo
OdooConnectorURL=Odoo URL
OdooConnectorDB=Database name
OdooConnectorUser=Username
OdooConnectorApiKey=API key
OdooConnectorApiKeyHelp=Odoo user API key (generated in Odoo under Settings → Users → API Keys). For accounts with two-factor authentication, the login password is rejected by the API.
OdooConnectorApiKeyKeep=(unchanged - leave empty to keep the stored key)
OdooConnectorSyncOptions=Sync options
OdooConnectorSyncInvoices=Sync customer invoices
OdooConnectorSyncSupplierBills=Sync vendor bills
OdooConnectorSyncExpenses=Sync expense reports
OdooConnectorSyncNow=Sync now
OdooConnectorManualSync=Manual sync
OdooConnectorSyncDateField=Filter by date field
OdooConnectorSyncDateFieldInvoice=Document date (invoice, bill or expense date)
OdooConnectorSyncDateFieldDue=Due date
OdooConnectorSyncDateFieldCreation=Creation date
OdooConnectorSyncDateFieldUpdate=Last update date
OdooConnectorSyncDateRange=Date range
OdooConnectorSyncRangeHelp=Filter the documents to sync by the date field selected above (expense reports have no due date: the expense date is used instead). Leave empty to sync the most recent documents regardless of date.
OdooConnectorSyncOnly=Document types to sync
OdooConnectorSyncOnlyAll=All types (invoices, vendor bills, expenses)
OdooConnectorSyncDone=Sync completed.
OdooConnectorSyncLog=Sync failures
OdooConnectorSyncLogHelp=Documents whose last push attempt failed. Fix the cause in Dolibarr or Odoo, then run sync again: a successful retry clears the entry automatically. Entries handled manually in Odoo can be dismissed with the button on the right.
OdooConnectorNoSyncFailures=No pending sync failures.
OdooConnectorClearSyncLog=Clear all
OdooConnectorDismissSyncLog=Dismiss
OdooConnectorSyncLogCleared=Failure log updated.
OdooConnectorActionPosted=posted-entry change
OdooConnectorActionDuplicate=duplicate in Odoo
OdooConnectorSyncLogTableMissing=The sync failure table does not exist yet: run the module SQL (sql/tables/llx_odoo_connector_synclog-odoo_connector.sql) or deactivate/reactivate the module.
OdooConnectorCronHelp=Sync runs automatically via the cron job "Odoo Connector sync (invoices, bills, expenses)". Configure it in Home → Setup → Cron jobs. You can also run sync manually with the button above.

OdooConnectorAccounting=Accounting mapping in Odoo
OdooConnectorTestConnection=Test connection
OdooConnectorTestOk=Connection OK (Odoo user id %s). Companies, journals and accounts were loaded from Odoo into the dropdowns below.
OdooConnectorTestFailed=Odoo connection failed: %s
OdooConnectorEntityMapping=Dolibarr entity
OdooConnectorEntityMappingHelp=All documents synced by the connector for Dolibarr entity %s are pushed to the Odoo company selected below.
OdooConnectorAuto=Automatic (first matching journal)
OdooConnectorNoTaxSplit=No tax line (push untaxed amount only)
OdooConnectorCompany=Odoo company ID
OdooConnectorCompanyHelp=Internal ID of the Odoo company (res.company) the synced records belong to, e.g. 1. Required because the Odoo database is multi-company. Use "Test connection" to load the company list.
OdooConnectorTaxAccount=Tax line account ID
OdooConnectorTaxAccountHelp=Internal ID of the Odoo account (account.account) used for the tax line. Leave empty to push the untaxed amount only.
OdooConnectorAutoAccount=Automatic (Odoo journal default account)
OdooConnectorRevenueAccount=Revenue account (customer invoices)
OdooConnectorRevenueAccountHelp=Account for the untaxed line of customer invoices and credit notes. Leave empty to let Odoo use the sales journal default account.
OdooConnectorDepositAccount=Deposit account (deposit invoices)
OdooConnectorDepositAccountHelp=Dolibarr deposit invoices are pushed as customer prepayments (liability), not revenue. Standard invoices that deduct deposits via lines/discount carry the net revenue. Leave empty to let Odoo use the sales journal default account.
OdooConnectorBillExpenseAccount=Expense account (vendor bills)
OdooConnectorBillExpenseAccountHelp=Account for the untaxed line of vendor bills and refunds. Leave empty to let Odoo use the purchase journal default account.
OdooConnectorSupplierDepositAccount=Deposit account (vendor deposit invoices)
OdooConnectorSupplierDepositAccountHelp=Dolibarr vendor deposit invoices are pushed as prepayments made to vendors (asset), not expenses. Vendor bills that deduct deposits carry the net expense. Leave empty to let Odoo use the purchase journal default account.
OdooConnectorExpenseAccount=Expense account (expense reports)
OdooConnectorExpenseAccountHelp=Account for the untaxed line of expense reports. Leave empty to let Odoo use the journal default account.
OdooConnectorSalesJournal=Sales journal ID
OdooConnectorPurchaseJournal=Purchase journal ID
OdooConnectorExpenseJournal=Expense journal ID
OdooConnectorExpenseJournalHelp=Journal used for expense reports (pushed as vendor-bill style drafts). Automatic = first 'general' journal of the company, else first 'purchase' journal.
OdooConnectorJournalAutoHelp=Leave empty to auto-select the first journal of the matching type (sale/purchase) in the company.

OdooConnectorAccountingDate=Accounting date
OdooConnectorAccountingDateSource=Accounting date source
OdooConnectorAccountingDateInvoice=Invoice date
OdooConnectorAccountingDateDue=Due date
OdooConnectorAccountingDateDelivery=Delivery / reception date
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateField=Delivery/reception date field
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateDefault=Default (ATA then ETA)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateATA=ATA (Actual Time of Arrival)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateETA=ETA (Estimated Time of Arrival)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateATD=ATD (Actual Time of Departure)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateETD=ETD (Estimated Time of Departure)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateUpdatedTime=Updated time
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateOther=Other (custom column name below)
OdooConnectorDeliveryDateFieldHelp=When "Delivery/reception date" is selected: for invoices linked to a shipment, use this expedition_extrafields date. For expenses, approval date is used.
OdooConnectorSyncShipmentDates=Refresh accounting dates from shipment updates
OdooConnectorSyncShipmentDatesHelp=Independent cron job. When a shipment's data changes within the lookback window below (e.g. ATA updated by ShipsGo), the accounting date of the linked Odoo DRAFT customer invoices and vendor bills is recomputed and updated - even for old invoices outside the main sync window. Create/enable the cron job "Odoo Connector shipment date refresh" in Home → Setup → Cron jobs (entity 1, method runShipmentDateSync of OdooSync, e.g. hourly). Posted moves are never touched.
OdooConnectorShipmentDateScanHours=Shipment update lookback (hours)
OdooConnectorShipmentDateScanHoursHelp=Shipments whose data changed within this many hours are examined. Keep it at least equal to the cron interval of the refresh job: overlapping runs are harmless, dates already correct are skipped.
ModuleFamilyHaopie=HaoPie
